{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02348",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.63,
      "end_seconds": 5.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Erm, hi, is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.55,
      "end_seconds": 10.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "come in please sit how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.1,
      "end_seconds": 17.19,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "Erm, good morning, doctor. I came along to to help out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.16,
      "end_seconds": 23.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "So, good, that'll be useful. Pull up a a chair."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 25.29,
      "end_seconds": 31.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "Doctor, it's a bone sticking out of my lower leg. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.79,
      "end_seconds": 37.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.49,
      "end_seconds": 49.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Right, bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.72,
      "end_seconds": 75.82,
      "duration_seconds": 10.1,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 96 percent, pressure 121 over 87, respiratory rate 16, pulse 117, temperature is 36.8 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.25,
      "end_seconds": 96.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.01,
      "end_seconds": 104.93,
      "duration_seconds": 7.92,
      "text": "I've had it it for about three months. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.74,
      "end_seconds": 108.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.83,
      "end_seconds": 134.48,
      "duration_seconds": 24.65,
      "text": "It usually comes with severe pain. With severe pain, a three out of ten, I suppose. I'd say all the time. I've had numbness in the foot too, for two weeks. Oh, and heavy bleeding. I mean, about heavy bleeding, it settles a little with pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.57,
      "end_seconds": 140.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Any head injury, loss of consciousness or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.02,
      "end_seconds": 144.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "no, uh, I'd have said so"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.16,
      "end_seconds": 147.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.77,
      "end_seconds": 150.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.18,
      "end_seconds": 155.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Right, any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.59,
      "end_seconds": 166.9,
      "duration_seconds": 10.31,
      "text": "Uh, I've had COPD, yes. I did try to ignore it for a while. I have an underactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.35,
      "end_seconds": 176.96,
      "duration_seconds": 8.61,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. Right, so COPD is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.58,
      "end_seconds": 199.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "what do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.79,
      "end_seconds": 205.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Tiotropium inhaler, once a day for my chest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 206.73,
      "end_seconds": 217.13,
      "duration_seconds": 10.4,
      "text": "Um, you know, it's meant to be once a day, though I don't see he take it every time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.99,
      "end_seconds": 225.96,
      "duration_seconds": 7.97,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, before this I was on thyroxine; that's been stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.19,
      "end_seconds": 234.05,
      "duration_seconds": 0.86,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.19,
      "end_seconds": 238.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.73,
      "end_seconds": 242.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.7,
      "end_seconds": 245.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.15,
      "end_seconds": 248.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.22,
      "end_seconds": 253.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.24,
      "end_seconds": 257.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.01,
      "end_seconds": 264.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.24,
      "end_seconds": 270.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.72,
      "end_seconds": 275.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "oh, I've never had an allergy"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.66,
      "end_seconds": 279.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.14,
      "end_seconds": 283.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "No, um, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.0,
      "end_seconds": 289.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "okay, time for me to examine you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.81,
      "end_seconds": 292.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.3,
      "end_seconds": 317.34,
      "duration_seconds": 6.04,
      "text": "There is a wound with bone visible and the foot is cool with no pulse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.75,
      "end_seconds": 337.33,
      "duration_seconds": 14.58,
      "text": "Alright, good, you can sit up again. Right, here's what I'm thinking. My working impression is an open fracture with a compromised blood supply. We shouldn't forget a vascular injury."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.05,
      "end_seconds": 341.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.05,
      "end_seconds": 359.16,
      "duration_seconds": 15.11,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with an open fracture with a compromised blood supply do well once it's treated properly. I'd like to arrange an urgent X-ray for open fracture"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 360.95,
      "end_seconds": 363.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "that's fine with me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.36,
      "end_seconds": 395.17,
      "duration_seconds": 30.81,
      "text": "I want blood tests done, that's for pre-operative. Let's use co-amoxiclav, 1.2 grams, now, single dose. That's for open fracture. Keep still, I am splinting the leg and sending you to theatre now. Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently. See me again straight away. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 396.2,
      "end_seconds": 400.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 404.11,
      "end_seconds": 405.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "So, take care now."
    }
  ]
}